                    <div>
                        <div class="nav-label">Next Chapter</div>
                        <div class="nav-title">Chapter 3: Appointment & Admission &#x2192;</div>
                    </div>
                    <span class="nav-arrow">&#x2192;</span>
                </a>
            </nav>
        </article>

        <div class="cta-section">
            <h3>Need Help Choosing the Right Hospital?</h3>
            <p>Our coordinators have direct relationships with China's top specialty hospitals. Get a personalized recommendation based on your specific condition.</p>
            <a href="../contact-new.html" class="cta-button">Get Free Hospital Matching &#x2192;</a>
