        <div class="header-content">
            <span class="chapter-badge">&#x1F4D6; Chapter 4 of 9</span>
            <h1>Common Diseases & Treatment Guide</h1>
            <p class="subtitle">Oncology, IVF, orthopedics, cardiac surgery, and more — what international patients come to China for and what to expect</p>
            <div class="meta-info">
                <span>&#x231A; 18 min read</span>
                <span>&#x1F527; Practical Level</span>
                <span>&#x1F3E5; Medical Tourism Guide</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main class="main-content">
        <article class="content-card">
            <nav class="toc">
                <h2>&#x1F4CB; What You'll Learn</h2>
                <ol class="toc-list">
                    <li><a href="#oncology"><span class="toc-number">1</span> Oncology & Cancer Treatment</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#ivf"><span class="toc-number">2</span> IVF & Fertility Treatment</a></li>
